#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140_Writhing Man"
msgid "Oh, no, no, no, no! I can't hold it. My poor designer suit.\\r\nThe cleaning bills alone!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey there. Everything all right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Writhing Man"
msgid "Urgh. Ooh. I know there's a one-in-a-million chance of this,\\r\nbut do you happen to have any stomach medicine on you? Oh,\\r\nplease say yes..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_Writhing Man"
msgid "No, I don't. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Writhing Man"
msgid "Oh, I... Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Writhing Man"
msgid "Oh, you know what? I do!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "224_Writhing Man"
msgid "Are you serious!? Oh, thank goodness! Please, can I have it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "236_Akiyama"
msgid "I feel bad saying it, but I'm afraid I can't let you have it\\r\nfor free. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
msgctxt "248_Writhing Man"
msgid "I'll pay! Oh, I'll pay! Before it's too late... Please!\\r\nQuickly! Help, help, help!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "I really am sorry."
msgstr "De verdad que lo siento."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "272_Writhing Man"
msgid "Oh, god. I told you I'd pay, didn't I? I'm at the end of my\\r\nrope here!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Akiyama"
msgid "(I feel bad for the guy, but there might be a better trade out there with my name on it.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "All right, fine. Take this, then."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "368_Composed Man"
msgid "Aaah... I'm saved. ♥"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "380_Composed Man"
msgid "Sorry you had to see me like that. It wasn't pretty. I mean,\\r\ntalk about catching a man at his worst! Heheheh."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "No problem..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "404_Composed Man"
msgid "Oh, that's right! I must thank you. I forgot myself for a\\r\nmoment there."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "416_Composed Man"
msgid "It's a little on the small side. I pray you won't take\\r\noffense."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "428_Akiyama"
msgid "Er, do you have anything besides money? Anything will do."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "440_Composed Man"
msgid "Hmm, anything but money? Don't hear that too often. You one\\r\nof those minimalist types or something?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Composed Man"
msgid "One moment. Let's see what I have here... What can I give\\r\nyou...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "464_Yoshio Iketeru"
msgid "Oh, I know. Would this do the trick? This is a ballpoint pen\\r\nthat popular model Yoshio Iketeru－aka yours truly－\\r\nhelped design."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "476_Akiyama"
msgid "A pen...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "488_Yoshio Iketeru"
msgid "Geez, don't get so excited... This is all I have. Well,\\r\nthis, and money."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "500_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm. All right, I'll take it. Thanks."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "536_Yoshio Iketeru"
msgid "Can you be any less enthusiastic?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "548_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh, no, this is great. See you around."
msgstr ""

